  "shapes": [
    "account-merge",
    "muxed-destination",
    "account-removed",
    "to-muxed-id-u64"
  ],
  "why": "The merge names an M address with ID 42, but the removed account's balance lands on the base G account and the ID survives only in the classic event's to_muxed_id. Readers that look for an account under the M address, or that model the merge as a payment and keep the source, misreport both sides.",
